  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう、恋鐘\r\nマフラーと……星？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035160020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん～、ツリーのてっぺんにつけるやつばい！\r\n形と色が可愛かね～ってのと……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490103516/4901035160020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035160030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちもツリーの星みたいに、\r\nてっぺんで輝けるアイドルになるばい……って！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103516/4901035160030"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035160040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そんな気持ちば、込めさせてもらったと！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103516/4901035160040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、なるほどな\r\n恋鐘の気持ち、受け取ったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も恋鐘がてっぺんで輝けるように、\r\n頑張らないとな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035160050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103516/4901035160050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この星、大事に飾っておくからな\r\n……あ、マフラーは手編みか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035160060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……う、うん\r\nそうなんやけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103516/4901035160060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035160070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そ、そいはあんまり気にせんでよかよ～～……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103516/4901035160070"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035160080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "手編みって気付かれるんは恥ずかしいけん……\r\n星と一緒にプレゼントしたんよ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103516/4901035160080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、あたたかそうだ\r\n帰るときにさっそく、使わせてもらおうかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901035160090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……うん！\r\nんふふ～、気に入ってくれたら嬉しか……！",
